    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "Before European settlers arrived, the land that is now North Bend was home to the Coos people.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        6
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://www.visitoregon.com/cities/north-bend-oregon/"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "North Bend became an incorporated city in 1903 after the merger of several local sawmill sites.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        17,
        26
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/North_Bend%2C_Oregon"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Early industries in North Bend included shipbuilding, timber harvesting, coal mining, and salmon canning.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        30
