      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/North_Bend%2C_Oregon"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "Sir Francis Drake is purported to have sought shelter for his ship, the Golden Hinde, around Cape Arago.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
